# Everything in here is GENERATED AND LOCAL. Nothing in public/ is committed.
#
# The reference artifacts used to be committed and refreshed by a weekly cron. They are not
# any more: `npm run dev` refetches the price history, and the Reference panel's Regenerate
# button rebuilds the artifact over whatever universe you have selected. A committed artifact
# would just be a stale copy of something you can rebuild in one click, and it went out of
# date against universe.js the moment a ticker was added.
#
# Rebuild:  npm run fetch      → backtest-history.json  (also run by `npm run dev`)
#           npm run backtest   → backtest-results*.json (or click Regenerate in the UI)
backtest-history.json
backtest-results.json
backtest-results-*.json
.gen-progress.log
